function jbcUsbContiPorts(f,count){let mask=jbcUsbContiMaskBefore(f),out=[];if(mask){for(let p=0;p<4;p++)if(mask&(1<<p))out.push(p);}if(out.length!==count){out=[];for(let p=0;p<count;p++)out.push(p);}return out;}
